  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:202px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Gos_recruit.jpg\" title=\"Guild of Shadows Recruit\"><img alt=\"Guild of Shadows Recruit\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"199\" src=\"/images/Gos_recruit.jpg\" width=\"200\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Gos_recruit.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Guild of Shadows Recruit</div></div></div>\n<p>The Guild of Shadows Recruit is an oversized <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Runt\" title=\"Orok Runt\">Orok Runt</a> Champion found on <a href=\"/wiki/The_Shadow's_Embrace\" title=\"The Shadow's Embrace\">The Shadow's Embrace</a> Level 1.  He is the object of the Quest <a href=\"/wiki/King's_Hit_List_Part_1\" title=\"King's Hit List Part 1\">King's Hit List Part 1</a> given by <a href=\"/wiki/Sir_Ving_N'Seacressy\" title=\"Sir Ving N'Seacressy\">Sir Ving N'Seacressy</a>.\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
